{
  "_doc": [
    "Kimi Code hook entries for the OpenViking memory plugin.",
    "Each element of `hooks` is merged into ~/.kimi-code/config.toml as a [[hooks]]",
    "table by setup-helper/install.sh. Fields follow the Kimi Code hook schema:",
    "event, matcher (optional regex), command, timeout (seconds, 1-600).",
    "",
    "__OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__ is a placeholder replaced by the installer with the",
    "absolute plugin install directory (~/.openviking/kimi-code-memory-plugin).",
    "",
    "Timeouts: UserPromptSubmit 5s (recall must never stall the prompt), Stop 45s",
    "(capture runs detached, this is only a fuse), SessionEnd 30s, PreCompact 30s",
    "(synchronous commit before compaction), SubagentStop 45s, SubagentStart 10s,",
    "SessionStart 10s (archive-overview prefetch is best-effort).",
    "",
    "Not wired on purpose: PostToolUse (observation-only, stdout is not injected,",
    "so the claude-code plugin's skill-experience feature has no kimi equivalent)",
    "and SessionHeartbeat (out of scope)."
  ],
  "hooks": [
    {
      "event": "SessionStart",
      "matcher": "startup|resume",
      "command": "node __OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__/scripts/session-start.mjs",
      "timeout": 10
    },
    {
      "event": "UserPromptSubmit",
      "command": "node __OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__/scripts/auto-recall.mjs",
      "timeout": 5
    },
    {
      "event": "Stop",
      "command": "node __OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__/scripts/auto-capture.mjs",
      "timeout": 45
    },
    {
      "event": "PreCompact",
      "matcher": "manual|auto",
      "command": "node __OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__/scripts/pre-compact.mjs",
      "timeout": 30
    },
    {
      "event": "SessionEnd",
      "command": "node __OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__/scripts/session-end.mjs",
      "timeout": 30
    },
    {
      "event": "SubagentStart",
      "command": "node __OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__/scripts/subagent-start.mjs",
      "timeout": 10
    },
    {
      "event": "SubagentStop",
      "command": "node __OV_KIMI_PLUGIN_DIR__/scripts/subagent-stop.mjs",
      "timeout": 45
    }
  ]
}
